olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">While it was hardly Boca Juniors v River P=
late at La Bombonera, Sunday=E2=80=99s eagerly anticipated match between Li=
verpool and Manchester City rated about 8.5 on the official Football Daily =
feist-o-meter by the Premier League=E2=80=99s comparatively tame standards.=
 The visitors walked out to a loud chorus of pantomime booing and some mild=
ly amusing banners reminding them of their serial cheating, there was some =
defiant =E2=80=9Cdoing=E2=80=9D of the Poznan in the away end and =E2=80=A6=
 er, that was about it. For all the faux media concern, one of the most hyp=
ed Premier League matches of all time passed off without anything much in t=
he way of flashpoints. We=E2=80=99ve seen more rancorous, heated physical e=
xchanges at the judging of the best Victoria sponge at the local church fet=
e.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Following a first half that will probably =
live no longer in the record books than it will in the memory of anyone for=
ced to watch it, <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u=
001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPg2w_TPTs=
Ge8dzC3LgZ2LyKnn-sP68IScLWUaLcMhBhtWh37j_0uH7moyMt3foTPXBi1ZlNvmUIdxbZ1ZmwF=
Typbjq3yE2-MOoV7DSD4V5idN6pI7D2fXQAQK3xhCDE8ODD_W2Xdlso9_kpQzOVUiOXDoLEZx8G=
NaF9lTiQGdynSzaidnkwucuDCKoNZSQSIyCLO1a6WWmEY1RCIqBs_oJcQMEEPSxpuFjES0GoxGl=
BRM/4ut/4mpTkoWCS3SJ_S5b15fzJw/h28/h001.utsmLR_Eqys9pbV7tfmQ5zYw_OKklkQn723=
JdIJKCys" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">City eventually won doing handstands</a=
> after Liverpool were reduced to 10 men. The visitors=E2=80=99 fans, playe=
rs and head coach have since been criticised for milking their win, althoug=
h given the simmering hostility they were subjected to, their smugness in t=
he face of emphatic victory was more than a little understandable. While it=
 is true that the vast majority of City=E2=80=99s current players are not t=
ainted by direct association with the financial chicanery perpetrated by th=
eir club=E2=80=99s owners until it came to a conveniently abrupt halt on th=
e final day of the 2017-18 season, it is fair to say the presence at the cl=
ub of many stars responsible for embarrassing Liverpool is not entirely unr=
elated to the skulduggery which preceded their arrival.</p>
</div></td></tr>
